@TaskApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5079

### Is it running?
GET {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### All tasks
GET {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Accept: application/json

### Only pending tasks
GET {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks?done=false
Accept: application/json

### Create a task
POST {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Buy printer paper", "isCompleted": false }

### One task
GET {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Accept: application/json

### Mark it done
PUT {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": 1, "title": "Buy printer paper", "isCompleted": true }

### Delete it
DELETE {{TaskApi_HostAddress}}/api/tasks/1
